{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free Demo of the puzzle game Lumines Arise. The Demo offers a sample of the single-player and multiplayer gameplay from the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three stages from the single-player Journey mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Burst Battle online multiplayer mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tutorial to learn the basic gameplay of Lumines Arise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: VR compatibility is not available in this Demo. Not all modes and options are present in this version. The stages are not shown in the same order in the final game. Game progress and statistics do not transfer. Difficulty in this demo is set to Easy; the full version will have multiple options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=====</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mind-blowing, fiendishly addictive reinvention of the puzzle classic Lumines from the creators of Tetris\u00ae Effect: Connected, where sound pulses through your body, mind, and every block you place, triggering dazzling visuals synched to the driving beat of an infectious, eclectic soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through over 30 stages of synesthetic sensory wonderlands, everything from lush jungles to buzzing Tokyo streets to more surreal experiences, matching blocks and crafting insane combos with the all-new Burst mechanic. Mix it up with a variety of other single-player modes and challenges, or test your mettle against friends or strangers in online multiplayer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re looking to get hyped up or chill out, new to the series or a veteran, have an hour to kill or just five minutes, want to play solo, with friends, or challenge strangers, or play in optional VR or stunning 4K, Lumines Arise is the ultimate puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/52a0199b582dfe2e65405c75be52c92f.avif?t=1756234302\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d15d5131ba264e7131ec0621c74e085d.poster.avif?t=1756234302\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d15d5131ba264e7131ec0621c74e085d.webm?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d15d5131ba264e7131ec0621c74e085d.mp4?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumines Arise is easy to pick up and play, but has incredible depth that\u2019s harder to master. Players manipulate 2x2 blocks of two colors that fall from the top of the screen, aiming to create Squares of a single color/type. A Timeline sweeps across the playfield to the beat of the music, clearing completed Squares and generating points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/536b0314538215ad9b374197c50360a2.avif?t=1756234302\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5ecb895b9de50e14b757a267d582841d.poster.avif?t=1756234302\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5ecb895b9de50e14b757a267d582841d.webm?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5ecb895b9de50e14b757a267d582841d.mp4?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stop on the over 30-stage single-player journey evokes a different and complex emotional response. From lush jungles, oceans teeming with life and snakes preparing to strike, to more electronic frontiers like the bustling streets of Tokyo and the endless expanse of outer space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/b348af93057c622fa9788b7f382d2e39.avif?t=1756234302\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d90fee17384bbce4fc75210f8b175420.poster.avif?t=1756234302\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d90fee17384bbce4fc75210f8b175420.webm?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d90fee17384bbce4fc75210f8b175420.mp4?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger the new Burst mechanic to stop a matched Square from clearing. Build it as large as you can until time runs out. When the Timeline starts clearing again, enjoy the show as screen-clearing combos rack up massive points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/62fbd2be99c99efe3f5284e3c45ae2c8.avif?t=1756234302\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/4462a9f3db8287171af1bc830d2e096a.poster.avif?t=1756234302\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/4462a9f3db8287171af1bc830d2e096a.webm?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/4462a9f3db8287171af1bc830d2e096a.mp4?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your player avatar from the largest selection of options the series has ever offered. It\u2019s a great way to express yourself and your personality when setting off on your in-game journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/91b7761b578d1962be669ecc44e076b9.avif?t=1756234302\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5bd1b1bf7f027fc38da6e03b947f714e.poster.avif?t=1756234302\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5bd1b1bf7f027fc38da6e03b947f714e.webm?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5bd1b1bf7f027fc38da6e03b947f714e.mp4?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the electrifying soundtrack by Hydelic, acclaimed composer of Tetris Effect: Connected and Rez Infinite\u2019s Area X, take you to new depths of immersion. You\u2019ll want to throw on a pair of your favorite headphones for maximum effectiveness. Use the Playlist feature to create a mix of stages with your favorite tracks or to set a specific mood.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847360?t=1756234302","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/07c09065ae3dc62319c35956a3fab9207f6e7be7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756234302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/7d643a9a4d14a5a4a20720612fdfd2022ff398e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756234302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/7d643a9a4d14a5a4a20720612fdfd2022ff398e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756234302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free Demo of the puzzle game Lumines Arise. The Demo offers a sample of the single-player and multiplayer gameplay from the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three stages from the single-player Journey mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Burst Battle online multiplayer mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tutorial to learn the basic gameplay of Lumines Arise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: VR compatibility is not available in this Demo. Not all modes and options are present in this version. The stages are not shown in the same order in the final game. Game progress and statistics do not transfer. Difficulty in this demo is set to Easy; the full version will have multiple options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=====</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mind-blowing, fiendishly addictive reinvention of the puzzle classic Lumines from the creators of Tetris\u00ae Effect: Connected, where sound pulses through your body, mind, and every block you place, triggering dazzling visuals synched to the driving beat of an infectious, eclectic soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through over 30 stages of synesthetic sensory wonderlands, everything from lush jungles to buzzing Tokyo streets to more surreal experiences, matching blocks and crafting insane combos with the all-new Burst mechanic. Mix it up with a variety of other single-player modes and challenges, or test your mettle against friends or strangers in online multiplayer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re looking to get hyped up or chill out, new to the series or a veteran, have an hour to kill or just five minutes, want to play solo, with friends, or challenge strangers, or play in optional VR or stunning 4K, Lumines Arise is the ultimate puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/52a0199b582dfe2e65405c75be52c92f.avif?t=1756234302\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d15d5131ba264e7131ec0621c74e085d.poster.avif?t=1756234302\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d15d5131ba264e7131ec0621c74e085d.webm?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d15d5131ba264e7131ec0621c74e085d.mp4?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumines Arise is easy to pick up and play, but has incredible depth that\u2019s harder to master. Players manipulate 2x2 blocks of two colors that fall from the top of the screen, aiming to create Squares of a single color/type. A Timeline sweeps across the playfield to the beat of the music, clearing completed Squares and generating points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/536b0314538215ad9b374197c50360a2.avif?t=1756234302\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5ecb895b9de50e14b757a267d582841d.poster.avif?t=1756234302\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5ecb895b9de50e14b757a267d582841d.webm?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5ecb895b9de50e14b757a267d582841d.mp4?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stop on the over 30-stage single-player journey evokes a different and complex emotional response. From lush jungles, oceans teeming with life and snakes preparing to strike, to more electronic frontiers like the bustling streets of Tokyo and the endless expanse of outer space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/b348af93057c622fa9788b7f382d2e39.avif?t=1756234302\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d90fee17384bbce4fc75210f8b175420.poster.avif?t=1756234302\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d90fee17384bbce4fc75210f8b175420.webm?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/d90fee17384bbce4fc75210f8b175420.mp4?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger the new Burst mechanic to stop a matched Square from clearing. Build it as large as you can until time runs out. When the Timeline starts clearing again, enjoy the show as screen-clearing combos rack up massive points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/62fbd2be99c99efe3f5284e3c45ae2c8.avif?t=1756234302\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/4462a9f3db8287171af1bc830d2e096a.poster.avif?t=1756234302\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/4462a9f3db8287171af1bc830d2e096a.webm?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/4462a9f3db8287171af1bc830d2e096a.mp4?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your player avatar from the largest selection of options the series has ever offered. It\u2019s a great way to express yourself and your personality when setting off on your in-game journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/91b7761b578d1962be669ecc44e076b9.avif?t=1756234302\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5bd1b1bf7f027fc38da6e03b947f714e.poster.avif?t=1756234302\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5bd1b1bf7f027fc38da6e03b947f714e.webm?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847360/extras/5bd1b1bf7f027fc38da6e03b947f714e.mp4?t=1756234302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the electrifying soundtrack by Hydelic, acclaimed composer of Tetris Effect: Connected and Rez Infinite\u2019s Area X, take you to new depths of immersion. You\u2019ll want to throw on a pair of your favorite headphones for maximum effectiveness. Use the Playlist feature to create a mix of stages with your favorite tracks or to set a specific mood.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Enhance","Monstars Inc."],"fullgame":{"appid":"2370000","name":"Lumines Arise"},"genres"